			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Update IPC channel response creation and streamline Wind Codegen types resolution\n\n- Replace direct property assignment with spread syntax for conditional error and headers inclusion in CreateResponseMessage and CreateEventMessage\n- Add @ts-ignore comments to suppress import errors for Wind Codegen types that are resolved from Target at runtime\n- Update tsconfig.json path mapping, removing alias for @codeeditorland/wind/Target/Codegen/*\n- Regenerate RouteManifest timestamp\n\nThis change improves IPC message construction and resolves type import issues for runtime-resolved modules.",
			"SHA": "1eb254473a6f0b173c6fed459c47d81841913026"
